2T17:57:19Z"},"body":"Fixes #118847.\r\n\r\n#114236 changed `PopupMenu::_draw_items` to skip invisible items in its loop, but missed the `i > 0` check for the separation of the first item, causing it to be inconsistent if the actual first item (i.e. `i == 0`) was filtered out.\r\n\r\nThis fixes that by applying the half separation for the first _visible_ item.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used to triage this issue as part of #118571, prompting this seemingly straight-forward change, which I've reviewed to the best of my ability._","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118849/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}